---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="页面未找到">
  <section class="not-found">
    <p class="section-label">ERROR / 404</p>
    <h1>这一页还没有被写进笔记。</h1>
    <p>链接可能已经变化，也可能是地址输入有误。</p>
    <a class="button primary" href="/">返回首页 <span>→</span></a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
